# Unit28
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2024红宝书考研英语词汇
# 描述: 基础词Unit28核心词汇

owe/oʊ/欠/He owes me 100 dollars.
own/oʊn/自己的/She has her own business.
pace/peɪs/步伐；节奏/He walked at a fast pace.
pack/pæk/打包/She packed her bags for the trip.
package/ˈpækɪdʒ/包裹/I received a package this morning.
pain/peɪn/疼痛/She felt a sharp pain in her back.
paint/peɪnt/油漆；画画/She painted a beautiful landscape.
pair/per/一对/She bought a pair of shoes.
palace/ˈpælɪs/宫殿/The royal palace is open to tourists.
pale/peɪl/苍白的/He looked pale after the illness.
panel/ˈpænl/面板；专家小组/A panel of experts reviewed the proposal.
panic/ˈpænɪk/恐慌/The crowd panicked when the fire broke out.
paper/ˈpeɪpər/纸；论文/She published a research paper last month.
parent/ˈperənt/父母/Parents should spend more time with their children.
park/pɑːrk/公园；停车/We had a picnic in the park.
parliament/ˈpɑːrləmənt/议会/Parliament debated the new law.
part/pɑːrt/部分/This is the most important part of the plan.
participate/pɑːrˈtɪsɪpeɪt/参加/All students are encouraged to participate in the activity.
particular/pərˈtɪkjələr/特定的/Is there a particular reason for your decision?
partly/ˈpɑːrtli/部分地/The project is only partly completed.
partner/ˈpɑːrtnər/搭档/She is my business partner.
party/ˈpɑːrti/聚会；政党/They held a birthday party for her.
pass/pæs/通过；经过/She passed the driving test.
passage/ˈpæsɪdʒ/通道；段落/Read the passage and answer the questions.
passenger/ˈpæsɪndʒər/乘客/The bus was full of passengers.
passion/ˈpæʃn/激情/She has a passion for music.
passive/ˈpæsɪv/被动的/He is too passive in social situations.
passport/ˈpæspɔːrt/护照/You need a passport to travel abroad.
past/pæst/过去的/Let's forget about the past and move on.
path/pæθ/小路；途径/There is a narrow path through the forest.
patient/ˈpeɪʃnt/病人；耐心的/The doctor examined the patient.
pattern/ˈpætərn/模式；图案/The pattern on the fabric is beautiful.
pause/pɔːz/暂停/She paused for a moment before answering.
pay/peɪ/支付/You need to pay the bill before leaving.
peace/piːs/和平/The two countries signed a peace agreement.
peak/piːk/顶峰/She reached the peak of her career.
peculiar/pɪˈkjuːliər/奇怪的/There is a peculiar smell in the room.
peer/pɪr/同龄人；窥视/Peer pressure can influence teenagers.
penalty/ˈpenəlti/处罚/The penalty for breaking the rule is severe.
pension/ˈpenʃn/养老金/He receives a monthly pension after retirement.
people/ˈpiːpl/人们/Many people attended the concert.
per/pər/每/The speed limit is 60 km per hour.
percent/pərˈsent/百分之/About 70 percent of the earth is covered by water.
perfect/ˈpɜːrfɪkt/完美的/Nobody is perfect.
perform/pərˈfɔːrm/执行；表演/She performed well in the exam.
perhaps/pərˈhæps/也许/Perhaps we should try a different approach.
period/ˈpɪriəd/时期/The exam period lasts for two weeks.
permanent/ˈpɜːrmənənt/永久的/He found a permanent job in the city.
permit/pərˈmɪt/允许/Smoking is not permitted in this area.
persist/pərˈsɪst/坚持/If you persist, you will succeed eventually.
person/ˈpɜːrsn/人/She is a very friendly person.
